Arabian Auction is the largest auction company in the Middle East. It has exclusive contracts to auction several governments and banks’ assets. Arabian Auction built its reputation in the distinguished number plates where the company achieved several world records.

ARABIAN AUCTION diversified its activities with the same success into real estates, and used vehicles with expansion to its physical and online bidding.

It allows you in real time to:

· Take you to a secure bilingual site;
· Register, pay deposit, and place bids;
· Browse through different categories of available auctions;
· View each auctionable item’s image and specifications, and monitor bid placement movement;
· Review auctions’ results;
· Take you to view location of auctionable property and our yard on Google® map;
· Email our staff directly.

Online Auction(OA) earlier known as Fujairah Auctions was founded in 2012. The idea stemmed from a research based in Asia, Europe, North Africa and America when the first online auction took place in 1995, to fabricate a state-of-the-art electronic auction system in GCC countries which benefits the customer from a remote location as well as to contribute to the increased trade exchange at the same time reducing the balance of economic deficit in those particular countries.

Since then prominent companies have started online auctions in GCC countries, but compromised services over financial gain, which caused mistrust among customers as well as other trading companies.

The need of the time was a competitive company that could regain the lost trust of customers and trading companies. Since the foundation of Fujairah auction now known as online auction we are trying our best to restore the confidence of our regional markets.

OA app is developed to run natively on Apple® mobile platforms. It allows you in real time to: 

· Browse through different categories of available auctions; 
· View each auctionable item's image and specifications, and monitor bid placement movement;
· Register, pay deposit, upload reciept and place bids;
· Review auctions' results, higher bids updates; 
· Take you to view location of auctionable item;
. Let you see auctionable property notes, details;
. Favourite any item;
· Email our staff directly . 

OA app is user friendly and easy to use application as comparison to other auction applications.

Since 2000 Online Auction Company have acclaimed to be the best emerging project in trade sector in 2015 winning the Sheikh Mohammad Bin Rashid Award, and being the member of Dubai SME.

As a result, Online Auction Company was among reputed companies, dealing with prominent group of companies, and exceeds 250,000 website and application users of diverse nationalities.
